        "text": "Skip navigation menu\n# The issues that matter:\nLearn more about our work together →\n# The issues that matter:\nLearn more about our work together →\n## Make a plan to vote by November 3rd!\n###### Election Day\n## November 3rd\n###### Early Voting\n## October 6th - November 3rd\n###### Register to Vote By\n## October 19th\n##### Check if you're registered to vote\n##### Register to vote\n##### Request a mail ballot\n##### Find your polling place\n## Making housing more affordable. Reducing our cost of living. Protecting our rights and democracy.\nHelp us do more, together.\n$10\n$25\n$50\n$100\n$250\nOther\n$10$25$50$100$250Other\n## Taking Back Congress\nby Harnessing Innovation\nWe launched Innovation for Good (I4G) to build a pragmatic, pro-innovation Democratic majority in Congress. We need a Congress that understands how we can leverage technology to tackle America’s greatest challenges with forward-looking solutions, and how to ensure that more Americans benefit from innovation. I4G will help us take back Congress in 2026 by targetting the Valley's support on competitive districts.\nLearn More\n## Get Involved Today",
